rules.content:
代码中包含过于复杂的逻辑表达式
示例：
'''php
if (($user->isActive() && $user->hasRole('admin')) || 
    ($user->isActive() && $user->hasPermission('edit') && !$user->isBlocked()) || 
    ($user->isSuperAdmin() && $user->getLoginCount() > 0 && $user->hasVerifiedEmail())) {
    // 处理逻辑
}
'''
建议重构为：
'''php
function canUserAccess($user) {
    if ($user->isSuperAdmin() && $user->isEligible()) {
        return true;
    }

    if (!$user->isActive()) {
        return false;
    }

    return $user->hasRole('admin') || 
           ($user->hasPermission('edit') && !$user->isBlocked());
}

function isUserEligible($user) {
    return $user->getLoginCount() > 0 && $user->hasVerifiedEmail();
}
'''

rules.content_en:
The code contains overly complex logical expressions
Example:
'''php
